            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Abbott narrows outlook, Australian stocks react to US-China trade",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> tracks today's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute, including Abbott Laboratories (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ABT\">ABT</a>) shares slipping after the company narrowed its full-year guidance, Amphenol (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/APH\">APH</a>) receiving an upgrade to Buy, and Australian stocks \u2014 like Australian Oilseeds (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/COOT\">COOT</a>) \u2014 are reacting to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/bessent-condemns-chinas-rare-earth-144048044.html\">the rare earth trade tensions </a>between the US and China.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
